== loading
ok Active and Connected are applied when the components are loaded, last component first
ok loading is over
ok never the design state
== connection
ok Connected
ok Database
ok OpenMode
ok BusyTimeout
ok Params
ok three datasets use the connection
ok the design position is read
== table
ok Connection: a reference to a later component
ok Active
ok TableName
ok IndexFieldNames
ok RecordCount
ok the first row in index order
ok TableName is stored
ok the generated SQL of a table
ok Params of a table
ok UpdateTable of a table
ok KeyFields of a table
== queries
ok Connection: a reference to an earlier component
ok Active
ok SQL
ok ReadOnly
ok RecordCount
ok a query without Active stays closed
ok SQL of a query is stored
ok Params of a query are published
ok the parameter of the SQL text
ok its name
ok opened by code
ok the row
ok events are bound to the form
== in-memory tables
ok FieldDefs is a collection
ok FieldDefs of an in-memory table are stored
ok FieldDefs of a table
ok the definitions
ok Active: opened empty from the definitions
ok no rows
ok the fields
ok Required
ok a control shows the appended row
ok a table without Active stays closed
ok its definitions
ok ReadOnly
== data sources
ok DataSet: a reference to a later component
ok DataSet of the list source
ok AutoEdit
ok DataSet of the third source
== grid
ok DataSource: a reference to a later component
ok two columns
ok column 0: FieldName
ok column 0: Title
ok column 0: Width
ok column 0: ReadOnly
ok column 0: bound to the field
ok column 1: FieldName
ok column 1: the title of the field
ok column 1: Width
ok column 1: Alignment
ok column 1: ReadOnly
ok Options
ok the grid shows the two columns
